// Phase 0 smoke query (build plan tasks 0.4 and 0.5).
// Expected for September 2026: Synerion hours 267,322 · actual revenue $6,033,393 (baseline confirmed 2026-11-04).
// Uses original model measures until the _app measures exist (Phase 1):
//   [Total Revenue (Master Hierarchy)] is Actual-scenario only (the original [Total Revenue] adds Backlog).
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    KEEPFILTERS ( DATESBETWEEN ( dim_calendar[date], DATE ( 2026, 9, 1 ), DATE ( 2026, 9, 30 ) ) ),
    "Synerion Hours", [Total Worked Hours],
    "Actual Revenue", [Total Revenue (Master Hierarchy)],
    "Last Refresh", [Last Refresh Date]
)
